{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026coGzGbSuPH1794975387.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金山郊野公園一帶向來有不少猴子出沒，近日便有大膽猴子公然在馬路上「截順風車」。網上日前流傳一段影片，拍下在金山郊野公園附近路段，一隻猴子竟爬上一輛私家車，穩穩掛在左邊車頭倒後鏡位置。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-18-12h12m56s638.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xwdJWDiQDE1794975354.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>面對這位突如其來的「乘客」，涉事私家車司機疑因顧慮猴子安全、害怕行車過快會弄傷牠，全程刻意保持慢速行駛，未有開得太快，然而該隻猴子卻毫不怯場，全程神態自若地留在倒後鏡位置，遲遲未肯落車離開。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-18-12h12m52s269.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026flDoVcNDlC1794975361.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片段上載至社交平台後迅速引爆網民討論，一眾網民被猴子淡定「坐車」的模樣逗樂，紛紛留言笑言：「馬騮搭順風車！」、「佢想遊車河」，亦有人替司機設計搞笑對白：「你唔走呀啦，我車你去警署」，亦有網民指司機照開車行為不妥當，留言：「整傷佢點算」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:05:49.759448+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:57:35.088901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:59:08.128609+00:00","content_hash":"607d52cf39e807296d177c62052fd3606a97379fb9f0925b7793658d4c9555e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:05:49.759448+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}